
Envelope

This is an envelope-based budget.  The idea is that you pre-allocate
funds into the budget, and you should only spend money in a category
if there are available funds to cover it.  All of the balances in
accounts should add up and reconcile to the current balance of the
bank account you're budgeting.

The the current state of this project is very unstable and not all
features have been implemented.

## Running

The server (MariaDB + Tomcat) runs in Docker; the Swing client runs on the host.

    mvn package                 # builds target/envelope.war and target/envelope-client.jar
    cd docker && docker compose up -d

The server comes up at http://localhost:7041/envelope/ (health check: /envelope/info/ping).
Launch the client with:

    java -jar target/envelope-client.jar

## Default credentials

The bootstrap (sql/bootstrap-mysql.sql) seeds two accounts with these
out-of-the-box passwords — change them after first login:

    admin / envelope
    guest / guest

